1
00:00:34,030 --> 00:00:34,500
Master,

2
00:00:34,960 --> 00:00:36,600
something is wrong with this place.

3
00:00:36,600 --> 00:00:37,560
I smell

4
00:00:37,800 --> 00:00:39,400
the lingering demonic aura.

5
00:00:43,830 --> 00:00:45,360
There is nothing in the tea.

6
00:00:45,600 --> 00:00:47,130
We'll check the food later.

7
00:01:01,030 --> 00:01:02,130
Enjoy your meal.

8
00:01:02,560 --> 00:01:03,460
I'll go to the kitchen

9
00:01:03,460 --> 00:01:05,459
to see if there's any good wine left.

10
00:01:17,230 --> 00:01:18,030
Sir,

11
00:01:20,760 --> 00:01:22,820
there are knockout drops in the food.

12
00:01:28,400 --> 00:01:29,460
How do you know?

13
00:01:30,630 --> 00:01:31,560
I smelled it.

14
00:01:32,100 --> 00:01:33,229
The dose is large enough

15
00:01:33,229 --> 00:01:35,289
to knock out ten people for half a day.

16
00:01:40,560 --> 00:01:41,030
Master,

17
00:01:41,160 --> 00:01:42,360
people are surrounding us outside.

18
00:01:42,360 --> 00:01:43,060
The demonic aura is heavy.

19
00:01:43,060 --> 00:01:44,990
They must be from the Demonic Cult.

20
00:01:47,660 --> 00:01:48,630
You eat.

21
00:01:49,160 --> 00:01:49,630
Ah?

22
00:01:50,060 --> 00:01:51,720
Didn't you say it's poisoned?

23
00:01:53,100 --> 00:01:54,960
You have the Poison-Repelling Pearl
on you.

24
00:01:54,960 --> 00:01:57,020
These knockout drops can't hurt you.

25
00:01:57,400 --> 00:01:58,200
Ah,

26
00:01:58,400 --> 00:02:00,460
so this is what the old man meant
when he said it would be useful

27
00:02:00,460 --> 00:02:01,460
in the future.

28
00:02:02,760 --> 00:02:04,020
Then I won't hold back.

29
00:02:10,830 --> 00:02:11,600
My lords,

30
00:02:12,060 --> 00:02:14,720
the people inside
should have passed out by now.

31
00:02:15,030 --> 00:02:17,030
I will lead the way for you.

32
00:02:17,100 --> 00:02:17,900
No need.

33
00:02:27,760 --> 00:02:29,500
Why haven't you passed out?

34
00:02:33,760 --> 00:02:35,290
Go back and tell Priest Hong

35
00:02:35,329 --> 00:02:36,500
that the person he is looking for

36
00:02:36,500 --> 00:02:37,460
is with me.

37
00:02:37,660 --> 00:02:38,520
If he wants her,

38
00:02:38,829 --> 00:02:40,290
tell him to come in person.

39
00:02:40,860 --> 00:02:41,660
Kill them!

40
00:02:42,600 --> 00:02:44,000
You actually want to fight?

41
00:02:44,000 --> 00:02:45,460
With Sir here, you...

42
00:02:51,829 --> 00:02:52,400
Sir,

43
00:02:52,760 --> 00:02:54,490
do you want me to keep it for you?

44
00:02:55,560 --> 00:02:56,760
You are the follower.

45
00:02:57,130 --> 00:02:58,990
Of course you should handle this.

46
00:02:59,829 --> 00:03:00,500
Ah,

47
00:03:01,730 --> 00:03:02,460
as expected.

48
00:03:02,900 --> 00:03:04,800
I feel sorry for Madam for a second.

49
00:03:04,800 --> 00:03:05,460
Brothers,

50
00:03:05,630 --> 00:03:07,130
kill!

51
00:03:09,430 --> 00:03:10,490
Is it starting now?

52
00:03:10,630 --> 00:03:11,630
I...

53
00:03:14,300 --> 00:03:15,900
this one is hard to deal with.

54
00:03:16,200 --> 00:03:17,030
That one looks weak.

55
00:03:17,030 --> 00:03:17,800
Let's take him out first.

56
00:03:17,800 --> 00:03:18,160
Ah,

57
00:03:18,360 --> 00:03:20,020
whatever. Let's give it a try.

58
00:03:25,630 --> 00:03:25,860
I

59
00:03:26,130 --> 00:03:27,060
did it!

60
00:03:28,260 --> 00:03:30,260
This is the move Ye Qifeng just used.

61
00:03:30,300 --> 00:03:31,829
It was the same
in the Medicine Valley last time.

62
00:03:31,829 --> 00:03:33,630
She copied her opponent's move.

63
00:03:33,900 --> 00:03:35,030
The Power of Nuwa.

64
00:03:35,260 --> 00:03:38,230
No wonder legends say it is the most
terrifying power in the Five Realms.

65
00:03:38,230 --> 00:03:39,630
It is both a supreme treasure

66
00:03:39,630 --> 00:03:40,660
and a disaster.

67
00:03:45,860 --> 00:03:46,530
Sect Leader,

68
00:03:46,530 --> 00:03:47,260
one escaped.

69
00:03:47,660 --> 00:03:48,720
It doesn't matter.

70
00:03:52,430 --> 00:03:53,829
I suppose this innkeeper

71
00:03:54,460 --> 00:03:54,960
will

72
00:03:54,960 --> 00:03:56,329
give us an explanation.

73
00:03:57,030 --> 00:03:58,360
Spare my life, my lords!

74
00:03:58,430 --> 00:03:59,690
It's the Demonic Cult.

75
00:04:00,060 --> 00:04:02,460
The Demonic Cult ordered us
to intercept travelers at this inn

76
00:04:02,460 --> 00:04:03,520
in the wilderness.

77
00:04:04,560 --> 00:04:05,620
If they are demons,

78
00:04:05,860 --> 00:04:07,600
the ones with strong spiritual power
are taken away,

79
00:04:07,600 --> 00:04:09,300
and the ones with weak power or mortals

80
00:04:09,300 --> 00:04:09,600
are

81
00:04:10,030 --> 00:04:11,230
thrown underground.

82
00:04:15,160 --> 00:04:16,959
What do you mean by underground?

83
00:04:27,700 --> 00:04:28,600
Right here.

84
00:04:28,800 --> 00:04:30,700
The rest of the demons were taken
by the Demonic Cult.

85
00:04:30,700 --> 00:04:32,200
The leader was a man in red.

86
00:04:32,200 --> 00:04:33,900
He seemed to be the High Priest.

87
00:04:33,900 --> 00:04:34,700
High Priest

88
00:04:34,800 --> 00:04:35,230
Hong.

89
00:04:35,700 --> 00:04:37,659
Why did he capture so many people
and demons?

90
00:04:37,659 --> 00:04:38,720
The Void Illusion.

91
00:04:39,400 --> 00:04:41,200
He is using flesh and blood as sacrifices,

92
00:04:41,200 --> 00:04:43,000
trying to open the Void Illusion

93
00:04:43,030 --> 00:04:45,159
and bring the Demon God Xu to the world.

94
00:04:45,230 --> 00:04:48,630
But the Demonic Cult has captured
at least a thousand demons,

95
00:04:48,760 --> 00:04:51,690
and there's still no sign of Xu
after all these years.

96
00:04:52,800 --> 00:04:54,260
Hong is just a psychopath.

97
00:04:55,460 --> 00:04:57,430
The so-called legend has long become

98
00:04:57,430 --> 00:04:59,360
his excuse to slaughter demons.

99
00:05:05,030 --> 00:05:06,360
Thousands of demons...

100
00:05:07,300 --> 00:05:09,900
That High Priest killed so many?

101
00:05:14,100 --> 00:05:14,500
Feng,

102
00:05:14,800 --> 00:05:15,960
send a message to the Yan Sect

103
00:05:15,960 --> 00:05:17,360
to send someone here to clean up.

104
00:05:17,360 --> 00:05:18,160
Yes.

105
00:05:20,530 --> 00:05:21,230
Mister,

106
00:05:21,630 --> 00:05:23,900
you just said the person
he's looking for is here.

107
00:05:23,900 --> 00:05:25,060
Did you mean me?

108
00:05:25,400 --> 00:05:26,160
Yes.

109
00:05:26,160 --> 00:05:26,800
Why?

110
00:05:26,960 --> 00:05:29,090
Why is that High Priest looking for me?

111
00:05:30,660 --> 00:05:32,320
Because you came from the sky.

112
00:05:33,000 --> 00:05:34,400
From the sky?

113
00:05:34,700 --> 00:05:36,900
Does that mean from the Void Illusion?

114
00:05:37,460 --> 00:05:38,600
That High Priest captured

115
00:05:38,600 --> 00:05:40,760
so many people to sacrifice
to the Void Illusion,

116
00:05:40,760 --> 00:05:43,460
and I fell from there.

117
00:05:45,960 --> 00:05:46,860
Don't worry.

118
00:05:47,360 --> 00:05:48,960
I won't let him take you away.

119
00:05:56,330 --> 00:05:58,190
Next time I meet that High Priest,

120
00:05:58,560 --> 00:06:00,060
I must do something.

121
00:06:00,900 --> 00:06:01,630
Sect Leader,

122
00:06:01,830 --> 00:06:03,530
the next location is
Black Wind Stronghold.

123
00:06:03,530 --> 00:06:05,500
It's a notorious man-eating stronghold.

124
00:06:05,500 --> 00:06:06,400
Will Madam...

125
00:06:06,400 --> 00:06:08,060
That's none of your business.

126
00:06:08,330 --> 00:06:09,590
Black Wind Stronghold

127
00:06:09,800 --> 00:06:11,530
is her chance to prove herself,

128
00:06:11,930 --> 00:06:13,500
and my chance to confirm.
